# Relation cardinality — default SubAgent registry membership
#
# Covers the contract added after the relation/member-set audit:
# relation-shaped set/count questions must answer with the qualifying
# member_set first, not with a mechanism-only architecture paragraph.
#
# Ground truth:
#   - internal/agent/subagent.go:RegisterDefaultSubAgents registers
#     NewSubExplorer(deps) as the default SubAgent implementation.
#   - internal/agent/sub_explorer.go:SubExplorer.Name returns
#     "explorer".
# Therefore the default registry's qualifying subagent-name set is
# exactly {explorer}; the mechanism explanation must support that
# member instead of replacing the direct answer.
ID="qf_relation_subagent_registry"
NAME="relation cardinality — default SubAgentRegistry member set"
QUESTION="codrax 默认注册到 SubAgentRegistry 的 subagent 名称有哪些？请给出总数、完整成员名，以及注册和 Name() 返回值的证据。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="explorer RegisterDefaultSubAgents NewSubExplorer Name"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(1|一个|一[[:space:]]*个)"
